<div style="width:1200px; box-sizing:border-box; padding:52px 40px 44px; background:#17130f; color:#c8c0b5;">

  <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; gap:32px; margin-bottom:8px;">
    <p class="lbl" style="color:#d9a55f;">Case one · what service design was for</p>
    <p class="lbl" style="color:#6b6157;">No Toyota blueprint is shown. This is the shape of the problem.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="disp" style="font-size:34px; color:#f0ebe3; margin-bottom:10px;">A disjointed experience is a faithful picture of a disjointed business</p>
  <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#9a9086; max-width:760px; margin:0 0 40px;">Once we were close enough to the Connected Technologies business to see how it operated, the gap was structural, not visual.</p>

  <p class="lbl" style="color:#9a9086; margin-bottom:16px;">Before &nbsp;·&nbsp; one slice, behaving as though it owned all of them</p>

  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr; align-items:stretch; margin-bottom:14px;">

    <div style="border:1px solid #332c25; border-radius:3px; padding:16px 14px; min-height:96px;">
      <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0 0 8px;">Choosing</p>
      <p style="font-size:11px; line-height:1.5; color:#6b6157; margin:0;">Another business unit</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;">
      <div style="width:11px; height:11px; border:1.5px dashed #7a6a52; border-radius:50%;"></div>
    </div>

    <div style="border:1px solid #332c25; border-radius:3px; padding:16px 14px; min-height:96px;">
      <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0 0 8px;">Buying</p>
      <p style="font-size:11px; line-height:1.5; color:#6b6157; margin:0;">Another business unit</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;">
      <div style="width:11px; height:11px; border:1.5px dashed #7a6a52; border-radius:50%;"></div>
    </div>

    <div style="border:1.5px solid #d9a55f; background:#241d14; border-radius:3px; padding:16px 14px; min-height:96px;">
      <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#f0ebe3; margin:0 0 8px;">Connected services</p>
      <p style="font-size:11px; line-height:1.5; color:#d9a55f; margin:0;">Ours. The only slice we could see.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;">
      <div style="width:11px; height:11px; border:1.5px dashed #7a6a52; border-radius:50%;"></div>
    </div>

    <div style="border:1px solid #332c25; border-radius:3px; padding:16px 14px; min-height:96px;">
      <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0 0 8px;">Living with it</p>
      <p style="font-size:11px; line-height:1.5; color:#6b6157; margin:0;">Another business unit</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;">
      <div style="width:11px; height:11px; border:1.5px dashed #7a6a52; border-radius:50%;"></div>
    </div>

    <div style="border:1px solid #332c25; border-radius:3px; padding:16px 14px; min-height:96px;">
      <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0 0 8px;">The next car</p>
      <p style="font-size:11px; line-height:1.5; color:#6b6157; margin:0;">Another business unit</p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:52px;">
    <div style="width:11px; height:11px; border:1.5px dashed #7a6a52; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0;"></div>
    <p style="font-size:13px; color:#9a9086; margin:0;">Four joins. Nobody accountable for any of them, and the customer crossing all four.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="lbl" style="color:#6fb0ab; margin-bottom:16px;">After &nbsp;·&nbsp; one journey, owned together</p>

  <div style="border:1.5px solid #6fb0ab; background:#12211f; border-radius:3px; padding:15px 18px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; margin-bottom:0;">
    <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#f0ebe3; margin:0;">One end-to-end journey</p>
    <p style="font-size:12px; color:#6fb0ab; margin:0;">Blueprinted front stage and back, reusable as service patterns</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr; align-items:stretch;">
    <div style="height:26px; border-left:1px solid #3d5c59; margin-left:50%;"></div><div></div>
    <div style="height:26px; border-left:1px solid #3d5c59; margin-left:50%;"></div><div></div>
    <div style="height:26px; border-left:1px solid #3d5c59; margin-left:50%;"></div><div></div>
    <div style="height:26px; border-left:1px solid #3d5c59; margin-left:50%;"></div><div></div>
    <div style="height:26px; border-left:1px solid #3d5c59; margin-left:50%;"></div>
  </div>

  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr 26px 1fr; align-items:stretch; margin-bottom:20px;">
    <div style="border:1px solid #2b3a38; border-radius:3px; padding:12px 14px;"><p style="font-size:13px; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0;">Choosing</p></div><div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #2b3a38; border-radius:3px; padding:12px 14px;"><p style="font-size:13px; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0;">Buying</p></div><div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #2b3a38; border-radius:3px; padding:12px 14px;"><p style="font-size:13px; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0;">Connected services</p></div><div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #2b3a38; border-radius:3px; padding:12px 14px;"><p style="font-size:13px; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0;">Living with it</p></div><div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #2b3a38; border-radius:3px; padding:12px 14px;"><p style="font-size:13px; color:#c8c0b5; margin:0;">The next car</p></div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#f0ebe3; max-width:820px; margin:0 0 30px;">Business units that had never designed anything together started working on the same journey. They are still doing it, which is the part I am most confident about, because it outlasted me.</p>

  <div style="border-top:1px solid #332c25; padding-top:20px; display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start;">
    <div style="width:9px; height:9px; border:1.5px solid #6fb0ab; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:6px;"></div>
    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; color:#6fb0ab; margin:0; max-width:820px;">The blueprints, the reusable service patterns and the playbooks were built by the service designers who were hired to make them. What I did was make the case for a capability nobody had asked for, and hire into it.</p>
  </div>

</div>
